    rdf:value """Saturday, August 26, 1916, Marina di Massa
Bathed twice. Motored back to look at sites. But both B.B. and I feel so ill and depressed here that I fear the sea doesn’t suit us. B.B. says he is thoroughly fed up and bored with Sybil, who only clings to him the more. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 203 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1916> .

